EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

I see that you've submitted your FAFSA for financial aid consideration at ASU. There are still a few documents that you need to submit before we review your financial aid package.

You can see these items on My ASU (http://my.asu.edu/) by selecting the Finances tab and looking at the Priority Actions.

In order to be considered for certain financial aid programs, you will need to submit the remaining items by June 1. This date is fast approaching so I encourage you to send these documents in as soon as possible.

If you have any questions about enrolling at ASU or financial aid, please contact me.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
